  "confidence": "high",
  "decision_summary": "After discounting inconsistent records, all evidence molecules support absolute oral bioavailability at or above 20%; most report F values of 61-97%, with the lowest direct absolute measurement at 29.9%. High bioavailability is therefore better supported.",
