    "Molecule 2 records conflate aspirin and salicylate; inconsistent cards were discounted.",
    "Molecule 10 includes one phenytoin record inconsistent with the phenylbutyrate records; it was discounted.",
    "A few non-absolute labetalol reports cite 18%, but direct absolute measurements in ordinary conditions are >=20%."
  ],
